.TH RATOS 1 "August 2026" "Ratatoskr 0.1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
ratos \- Ratatoskr networking toolkit
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B ratos dns
.RI [ type ] " name " [ options ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B ratos
is the native CLI for Ratatoskr. The initial command queries DNS through the same C
core used by language bindings.
.SH DNS TYPES
A, AAAA, CNAME, MX, TXT, NS, PTR, SOA, SRV, NAPTR, and CAA.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-s ", " \-\-server " " address
Use an explicit IPv4 or IPv6 resolver.
.TP
.BR \-\-port " " port
Use a resolver port other than 53.
.TP
.BR \-\-timeout " " milliseconds
Set the transport timeout.
.TP
.B \-\-json
Write stable structured JSON.
.TP
.B \-\-verbose
Write diagnostics to stderr.
.SH EXIT STATUS
0 success; 1 general failure; 2 invalid arguments; 3 timeout; 4 network failure;
5 DNS/protocol failure; 6 unsupported operation; 7 permission denied.
.SH EXAMPLES
.nf
ratos dns a example.com
ratos dns ptr 1.1.1.1
ratos dns example.com --server 1.1.1.1 --json
.fi
